// "Sacrificed" = a permanent moves battlefield → graveyard by SACRIFICE —
// the cause-narrowed dies-view ([CR#701.21a]: its controller moves it to
// its owner's graveyard; a sacrifice is never a destruction, so it can't
// be regenerated). The cause verb is the closed CauseVerb vocabulary,
// spelled bare: `Cause(verb: Sacrifice)`.
// Usage: Sacrificed(what) — e.g. Sacrificed(Type(Creature)).
(
    name: "Sacrificed",
    template: "${0} is sacrificed",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: ZoneChange(what: Param(0), from: Battlefield, to: Graveyard, cause: Cause(verb: Sacrifice)),
)
